# This repo is cloned/pulled onto Linux (Raspberry Pi OS) but often edited from a Windows dev
# machine (see auto_update.py's git-pull-based self-update). Force LF for every text file
# regardless of which OS commits it, or Windows' default CRLF normalization would silently break
# the shebang line on every .sh script the moment someone edits/commits from Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
